e workflow before activating the SLA.\",\"SLAItem_ApplicableAndSuccessSameAttribute\":\"We recommend that you avoid configuring the applicable when and success criteria on the same attribute\",\"WorkflowOwnerIsDisabled\":\"Owners in the following SLA Workflows : {0} need to be updated with the active users.\",\"NoSLASetAsDefault\":\"Default SLA is not maintained for the entity {0}.\",\"OpenLearnMoreForSetAsDefaultSLA\":\"Learn more\",\"SLAKPI_Recommendation_Entityname\":\"Entity needs to be enabled for SLA.\",\"SLAKPI_Recommendation_KPIField\":\"KPIs are based on the Entity selected.\",\"SLAKPI_Recommendation_PrimaryEntity\":\"Entity needs to be enabled for SLA.\",\"SLA_WebClientDeprecationNotification\":\"Effective April 01, 2023, the legacy Service Level Agreements (SLAs) on web client that were deprecated earlier, have passed End of Support (EoS). It is crucial to migrate your legacy SLAs that were created on web client to the Unified Interface experience immediately to avoid functionality loss. For more information on how to migrate the items, see {0}\",\"SLA_WebClientDeprecation_Ack_Button_Text\":\"I acknowledge\",\"SLA_WebClientDeprecation_Cancel_Button_Text\":\"Cancel\",\"SLAKPI_Activation_Error_Message\":\"Failed to activate SLAKPI, please acivate it from manage SLAKPIs.\",\"SLAKPI_Performance_Indicator_Notification\":\"SLA KPIs are performance indicators\",\"SLA_ChangedAttribiteNullNotification\":\"You need to reactive the SLA {0} to fix the issues identified with the conditions in it. For more information, see {1}\",\"SLA_RelatedEntitiesNotification\":\"Related entities configured in the conditions for SLA Item {{0}} are not fully supported. For more information, see – {1}\",\"SLA_DisableLegacyCreateSLADialogDepreciationText\":\"Effective October 1, 2020, SLAs are deprecated in the web client. For more information, go to - {0}\",\"SLA_DisableLegacyCreateSLADialogConfirmationText\":\"Select ‘OK’ to continue creating the new SLA in Unified Interface.\",\"SLA